:: Start [nobr]
<div class="phone">
  <div class="header"><span>Learn the Basics</span></div>
  <h1>Understanding helps you stay well</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    Understanding how blood pressure works makes it easier to take care of
    yourself. When you know why a habit helps, it is easier to keep it up.
  </p>
  <div class="primary-cta">
    <<button "Next">>
      <<goto "Why">>
    <</button>>
  </div>
</div>

:: Why [nobr]
<div class="phone">
  <div class="header"><span>Learn the Basics</span></div>
  <p class="lead">
    High blood pressure often has no symptoms, which is why it is called the
    silent condition. Learning the signs, the numbers, and the habits puts you
    in control.
  </p>
  <p class="lead">
    These games turn the science into something you can see and play with, so it
    sticks.
  </p>
  <div class="primary-cta">
    <<button "Next">>
      <<goto "Play">>
    <</button>>
  </div>
</div>

:: Play [nobr]
<div class="phone">
  <div class="header"><span>Learn the Basics</span></div>
  <h1>How to play</h1>
  <p class="lead">❤️ <b>Know the numbers</b> — what a healthy reading looks like.</p>
  <p class="lead">🏘️ <b>See the effects</b> — how pressure touches the whole body.</p>
  <p class="lead">🎯 <b>Test yourself</b> — quick questions to lock it in.</p>
  <p class="lead"><i>Answer questions and make choices. Each round teaches one heart-healthy idea.</i></p>
  <div class="primary-cta">
    <<button "See the games">>
      <<run
        try {
          if (window.FlutterBridge && window.FlutterBridge.postMessage) {
            window.FlutterBridge.postMessage(JSON.stringify({ type: "CCQ_OPEN_GAMES" }));
          }
        } catch (e) {}
      >>
    <</button>>
  </div>
</div>
